{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "bfa4e79fcceac473e6abcdafc42013fa73c56a82127819f3f7f2cd2136418bf1", "ja": "ライブMC　～めいっぱい楽しむ～", "zh": "演唱会主持　～尽情狂欢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9979f0cc7dc556b2a675495df26546a96e47e96bdae76d5fa89069dd1636a875", "ja": "緊張しているエミリーを見かねた真美が代わ\nりに観客を盛り上げる。そして、静香や星梨\n花の公演を楽しむ姿に、エミリーの緊張も\n自然とほぐれていく。まだライブははじまっ\nたばかり……最後まで一緒に駆け抜けよう。", "zh": "艾蜜莉情绪紧张，看不下去的真美代替她\n带动观众的情绪。而看到静香和星梨花\n公演时乐在其中的模样，艾蜜莉的紧张也\n自然而然消除了。演唱会才刚开始……\n大家要一起奔驰到最后一刻。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_02_1000_032emi", "source_sha256": "cef199c52c311e6bb67cf7968769c57ef9a76eb7a0f4e54e9b58043af4c02af1", "ja": "み、みなさま！　劇場の祝賀記念公演にご来場いただき\n誠にありがとうございます！　本日はお日柄もよく……", "zh": "非、非常感谢各位莅临剧场的祝贺纪念公演！\n今天是个黄道吉日……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_02_1001_012mam", "source_sha256": "a692c3c01c699061a1578216936479828726738ac9e344c1c3c0091dc8e4be5c", "ja": "ストーップ！", "zh": "停──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_02_1002_032emi", "source_sha256": "5f3f670757bcabbbc1c0d9c5f0b106e98375761d860a03ebe64f5f223e282336", "ja": "oh！　ま、真美さん……？\nどうしたのですか？", "zh": "Oh！真、真美……？\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_02_1003_012mam", "source_sha256": "0b3d9c33e41d20762e260ad51750b2590027039f19602031a6fa604802c1eb43", "ja": "カタいよなでしこ～、カタ焼きせんべいよりカタいよ！\nこういうときの挨拶は……こうだーっ！", "zh": "太僵硬了大和抚子～比坚烧仙贝还要硬！\n这种时候打招呼……要像这样──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_02_1004_012mam", "source_sha256": "8d489651b516030bf9bcf5b4e2502a41c8d361f955e24901a92e00f2397583fe", "ja": "イエーイ！　会場の兄ちゃんと姉ちゃん達～？\n真美達と遊ぶ準備はできてるかーっ！？", "zh": "耶～！会场里的大哥哥、大姊姊们～\n大家准备好跟真美我们玩了吗～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_02_1005_null", "source_sha256": "9f9404d5e94fcf78798a24d440968e5d5f0f8815f497d211f3a3fa92514c1545", "ja": "ワアアアアアアアア！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_02_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "3ca8d9a6ec2772a289af0647c650c5ebfc5da73eee84de821a0dadf56e53e6e1", "ja": "真美、エミリーのMCに割り込まないのっ。……けど、\nそうね。エミリー、もう少しリラックスしましょう。", "zh": "真美，艾蜜莉主持时你不要打岔……\n不过也对啦，艾蜜莉你可以再放轻松一点～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_02_1007_032emi", "source_sha256": "cc330f5bfa6b238e96e0d7cf66b8d464b85430fc5345fc4477a24854fac35b10", "ja": "は、はい！　すみません、私……。\n特別な公演なものですから、緊張してしまって。", "zh": "好、好的！对不起……\n因为这场公演很特别，我太紧张了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_02_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "46482f73ccb85fec59edc656b338edc15478711679c2a9641a476da4f71e4ad5", "ja": "大丈夫です、エミリーちゃん！　今日は会場の\nみなさんと一緒に、めいっぱい楽しんじゃいましょう！", "zh": "放心，小艾！\n今天我们就跟会场里的大家一起尽情狂欢吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_02_1009_012mam", "source_sha256": "2ca2e3733580ce4784cf0c0409dee0164b0b2a5e0c2ba5e6943a103771b13a60", "ja": "んっふっふ～。どうやら、お許しが出たようですな～。\nさあ、今日はめいっぱい遊ぶぜーっ！", "zh": "嗯哼哼～看来得到许可了呢～\n来吧，今天要玩个痛快──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_02_1010_null", "source_sha256": "9f9404d5e94fcf78798a24d440968e5d5f0f8815f497d211f3a3fa92514c1545", "ja": "ワアアアアアアアア！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
