{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_02_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "559bb99b6c1d11eaa38ff0be6df4e853bdb4fc18e489abaa3574757896a100f1", "ja": "遊ぶっていうか、楽しんでくださいね！\nあ、途中途中で水分補給とかも忘れずに！", "zh": "该说是玩吗，总之请大家好好享受喔！\n啊，途中也别忘了随时补充水分！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
